-- Rule #8 retirement: the write protocol verifies claimed-novel ids
-- in-transaction and bulk-COPYs directly (NpgsqlWorkingSetApply); the period
-- fold runs client-side in ConsensusAccumulatingWriter against the same native
-- glicko-2. The server-side apply/fold entry points below have no callers and
-- are dropped on upgrade.
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.laplace_apply_batch(text);
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.consensus_fold_partition_incremental(text, boolean);
